---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Get involved" description="Ways to help: propose a project, volunteer, partner, or just introduce yourself.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Get involved</h1>

    <p>
      We're small, which means a single thoughtful contribution can shape a lot. Before anything else, please read our <a href="/charter">Charter</a> and <a href="https://github.com/">Code of Conduct</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 id="propose-a-project">Propose a project</h2>
    <p>
      Open a GitHub issue titled <code>Project proposal: &lt;name&gt;</code> and describe:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>the problem, and the people it affects;</li>
      <li>the approach you have in mind;</li>
      <li>the risks you can already see.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>How a proposal becomes a project page is described in our <a href="https://github.com/">PLAN</a>.</p>

    <h2 id="volunteer">Volunteer time or skills</h2>
    <p>
      Open an issue titled <code>Volunteer: &lt;your skill or interest&gt;</code>. Design, writing, translation, accessibility review, research, partner outreach, code — all welcome.
    </p>

    <h2 id="partner">Partner with us</h2>
    <p>
      If you work for an NGO, research group, or community organization, open an issue titled <code>Partner inquiry: &lt;your org&gt;</code> or email us at the address on the <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.
    </p>

    <h2 id="support">Support us</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      We don't accept donations yet — we're not a registered legal entity, so we can't accept them properly. When that changes, we'll say so here.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
